INSERT INTO question_bank_2_examples (id, group_id, content, sequence)
VALUES (
  '5d24dcb9-45b5-50c8-b1dc-365f59cd046c', 'e4a06421-f3cf-5751-ab21-ef3da1d452c7',
  '31. Consider the following function:

```c
int binarySearch(int *arr, int left, int right, int target){
    if(left > right) return -1;

    int mid = left + (right - left)/2;
    if(arr[mid] == target) return mid;

    if(arr[mid] > target)
        return binarySearch(arr, left, mid - 1, target);

    return binarySearch(arr, mid + 1, right, target);
}
```

Assuming n is size of array $arr$. What is the recurrence equation of **binarySearch** function? (c = const)

Lựa chọn:
- $T(n) = T(n/2) + c$
- $T(n) = c$
- $T(n) = T(n - 1)$
- $T(n) = 2T(n - 1)$', 31
);

